From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] po: Airplane Mode and the USB tile's new rows

Translations of the strings of 0081 (the "Airplane Mode" tile) and 0082
(webcam and powering the connected device in the USB quick setting) for
de, fr, es, it, pt, pt_BR (as pt), nl, pl and ru, kept apart so that both
patches stay free of po hunks.
---
 po/de.po    | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 po/es.po    | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 po/fr.po    | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 po/it.po    | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 po/nl.po    | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 po/pl.po    | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 po/pt.po    | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 po/pt_BR.po | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 po/ru.po    | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 9 files changed, 270 insertions(+)

